<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 631.97, down 2.37.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.09.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 306 to 261.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume 27,065,160 was compared with 16,743,150 on Thursday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1330 EST/1730 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
